; ==============================================================================
; MARK: 11-4: 💬 最後の審判
; ==============================================================================
; ＠ト書き▼議論11-4最後の審判
; 議論開始カットイン
; BGM継続：yUki

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_48_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
# Judge11-4-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:正如我所说明的，<br>人类之所以应当被消灭，<br>是因为曾经犯下的罪孽。|#0206Trial04_Yuki001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:请接受<br>命运吧。|#0206Trial04_Yuki002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL7,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open04
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……【嗯嗯好的】……<br>我们怎么可能<br>就这么答应啊？|#0206Trial04_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1,ArmR2,ArmL2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:说、说得对哇！|#0206Trial04_Hanna001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:无论你们<br>有多么可怜，<br>也不能成为我们<br>必须默默被杀的<br>理由啊——！|#0206Trial04_Hanna002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.9
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"……但是，<br>你们真的有<link=\"Objection_02_06_04_01\">资格</link><br>说这种话吗？|#0206Trial04_Yuki003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.9
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:在座各位，<br>要么是已经犯下罪行的人，<br>要么是<br>反过来被人类<br>残酷对待过的人……|#0206Trial04_Yuki004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.15
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:不管是成为受害者的心情，<br>还是作为加害者的心情，<br>你们都应该很清楚吧。|#0206Trial04_Yuki005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:只要是被人类折磨过的人，<br>都一定理解。<br>——理解我渴望复仇的心情。|#0206Trial04_Yuki006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.7
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:而犯下罪行的人，<br>也肯定明白。<br>——明明和我一样是加害者，<br>有什么资格<br>来指责我？<br>|#0206Trial04_Yuki007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.11
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:4
@PrintDebateText Text:"同为<link=\"Objection_02_06_04_02\">屠杀者</link>……<br>我们还是和睦相处吧？|#0206Trial04_Yuki008|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile,ArmL4,ArmR1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:哎呀。<br>既然要和睦相处，<br>能不能顺便<br>放我一马呢？|#0206Trial04_Margo001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.3
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:放心吧。|#0206Trial04_Yuki009| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:你们<br>因魔女化<br>而增强的力量，<br>虽然已经作为<br>构成我肉体的素材<br>消耗掉了——|#0206Trial04_Yuki010| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:即便如此，<br>你们身上<br>原有的魔女因子<br>也不会<br>完全消失。|#0206Trial04_Yuki011| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:所以，你们不会有特殊对待，<br>我会让你们和其他人类手拉手，<br>和和睦睦地去死哦。|#0206Trial04_Yuki012| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:【和和睦睦地去死】，<br>是什么鬼啊。<br>人家压根就不想死，<br>懂？<br>喂喂～，<br>你听得懂人话吗～？|#0206Trial04_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL11,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Wink_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Yum_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:能不能通融一下，<br>比如说把人类灭亡的日子<br>稍微延后点！|#0206Trial04_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.8
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"人类死亡的命运，<br>不会改变。<br>谁也<link=\"Objection_02_06_04_03\">无法动摇</link>。<br>|#0206Trial04_Yuki013|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

